    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 47 Belmont is a spacious and well-appointed two-bedroom apartment ideally situated on first floor of this well-established development, enjoying a superb city centre location with every conceivable amenity within reach.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with two practical storage rooms and hot press, a bright open-plan living and dining area, a separate kitchen positioned to the rear, two spacious double bedrooms, and a well-proportioned modern style bathroom. The apartment offers an excellent balance of living and bedroom accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a convenient city residence.\n\nThe location is second to none, positioned within easy reach of Dublin City Centre and a host of amenities. Fairview Park and the Clontarf seafront are both nearby, offering wonderful recreational opportunities, while the IFSC, East Point Business Park and Grand Canal Dock are all easily accessible. The area benefits from an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, schools and colleges, paired with superb transport links including numerous bus routes, Connolly Station and the Luas. The Port Tunnel provides swift access to the M1, Dublin Airport, the M50 and beyond."
      },
